# LeadFlow Client Environment Configuration (Optional)
# In development, Vite automatically proxies /api and /socket.io to http://localhost:5000
# For decoupled production deployments (e.g. Vercel / Netlify frontend pointing to Render / Railway backend):
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# VITE_WS_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
